B.zM={"Diretoria do Bol\xe3o":0,"1 KSV Astrophysik 26":1,"Mainz 06":2,"Lang Tech+Agronutri":3,"Fam\xedlia Fiusa":4,"SAF #Arda":5,"MWCSPM ft Pentemel\xe3o":6,RTFC:7,"Gr\xeamio/Atl\xe9tico AdS":8,Lorenhell:9,"Edmilsons United":10,"Panteras FC":11,"Tg-(UK)-ezers":12,AstroSoccer:13,"Deportivo Dona Maria":14,"AC Shevy":15,"DGE Esporte Clube":16,"Fam\xedlia Guedes Lang":17,"LDU Astrof\xedsica":18}
B.yF=new A.Y(B.zM,["*Diretoria do Bol\xe3o*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Gamma Arena\n*M\xe9dia de gr\xe1ficos gerados por dia:* 107,3\n*Capit\xe3o:* Eskeleto\n*Participantes:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49, Caio, Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Eskeleto, Fiusa, Kaka, Pelanza, Tgueze \ud83e\udd48 e Xand\xe3o\n\nCome\xe7amos com o time do chefe. Assim como a CBF precisa ter o Flamengo, a Gamma Bol\xf5es Ltda. vem com o seu pr\xf3prio time. Um time de muito trabalho e qualidade no que diz respeito a preparar o bol\xe3o, mas quando falamos da competi\xe7\xe3o em si, um time de performance hist\xf3rica p\xedfia digna de uma Nova Zel\xe2ndia. Capitaneada pelo CEO do Bol\xe3o, Eskeleto, a Diretoria do Bol\xe3o vem com os 9 participantes que formam o n\xfacleo central do grafo do bol\xe3o, com todo participante tendo de alguma forma uma conex\xe3o a pelo menos um dos 9 diretores. O clima no vesti\xe1rio esse ano \xe9 diferente e os jogadores prometem seriedade na disputa, mas veremos ao longo das pr\xf3ximas semanas se o time seguir\xe1 sendo o time pequeno com carisma que todo mundo apoia quando briga para n\xe3o cair ou transformar-se-\xe1 num concorrente real ao t\xedtulo, levantando discuss\xf5es sobre manipula\xe7\xe3o no Bol\xe3o.","*1. KSV Astrophysik 26*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Gebbertstra\xdfe - Erlangen, Alemanha\n*Quantidade de quadras liberadas por Guido para a prepara\xe7\xe3o:* 0\n*Capit\xe3o:* Martin \ud83e\udd47\n*Participantes:* Benedetta, Bennie S\xe1nchez, Franzi, Gerrit, Hannes, Jelena, Jonas F., Martin \ud83e\udd47 e Stefan\n\nExiste o estere\xf3tipo de que f\xedsicos n\xe3o s\xe3o muito f\xe3 de futebol e, enquanto estere\xf3tipos n\xe3o se aplicam a todas as pessoas, o Eskeleto de 2010 pode compartilhar o choque que foi verificar que em geral esse era o caso. Por tal motivo, a Federa\xe7\xe3o Internacional de Estudos Esportivos Astrof\xedsicos estava temerosa em n\xe3o conseguir formar um time para o Bol\xe3o dos Bol\xf5es. Maaas, se existe algo mais forte nos f\xedsicos do que a falta de interesse por futebol, \xe9 o hiperfoco em gr\xe1ficos e an\xe1lises estat\xedsticas! Com isso, o problema se inverteu. N\xe3o s\xf3 foi muito f\xe1cil formar uma equipe, como acabou-se juntando mais participantes do que a regra permite em uma s\xf3 equipe e por isso, foi necess\xe1ria uma divis\xe3o. De um lado, o time europeu que, gra\xe7as \xe0 efici\xeancia alem\xe3, j\xe1 tem sua lista de convoca\xe7\xe3o finalizada. Liderado pelo campe\xe3o do Bol\xe3o da Euro 24, Martin, o esquadr\xe3o foi quase formado somente por alem\xe3es, mas, no fim, n\xe3o poderiam ter deixado de fora sua colega de UE, Benedetta, que j\xe1 tem de viver com a dor de estar indo para a terceira Copa sem seu pa\xeds. Com isso, o 1. Kicktipp Sport Verein Astrophysik 26 vem como a \xfanica equipe inteiramente europeia e a \xfanica equipe sem brasileiros. Na hist\xf3ria da Copas, foram 11 Copas na Europa, 10 vencidas por europeus, e 11 Copas fora da Europa, somente 2 vencidas por europeus. Ser\xe1 que o 1. KSV Astrophysik 26 tem o que \xe9 necess\xe1rio para quebrar esse tabu e levar a ta\xe7a da Am\xe9rica do Norte para a Europa?","*Mainz 06*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Mewa Arena - Mainz, Alemanha\n*Sorvetes tomados \xe0 beira do Reno numa tarde de ver\xe3o:* 12.423\n*Capit\xe3o:* Caio\n*Participantes:* BitoBike, Caio, Carol Akemi, Chris Blum, Dominik, Eric Che Schmitt, Joana Figueiredo, Regueba e Yannic\n\nAquele sorriso, aquele maldito sorriso... se voc\xea mora na cidade de Mainz, sabe muito bem que estou falando do sorriso resplandecente de J\xfcrgen Klopp, o hist\xf3rico treinador que em 2004 levou o time alvi, rubro e dourado a seu acesso \xe0 primeira divis\xe3o, de onde o time nunca mais saiu... Oi? Ah, desculpa, entendi errado... Aparentemente eu n\xe3o deveria estar falando do Mainz 05, mas sim de seu sucessor, o Mainz 06! Liderado e formado pelo analista de conte\xfado do bol\xe3o, nosso querido Caio, o time traz uma mistura de Brasil, Alemanha e Portugal, mas com um ponto de conex\xe3o em comum: a cidade de Mainz, capital da Ren\xe2nia-Palatinado (t\xe1 bom, Caio, t\xe1 bom, eu falo que na cidade tem um rio!). De um lado, o time traz um dos competidores para melhor nome do bol\xe3o: BitoBike. Do outro lado, o time traz diversos ~bi\xf3logos~ biotecnologistas, aparecendo como um dos dois times da bio para bater de frente com os dois times da astrof\xedsica, alimentando a guerra milenar entre f\xedsicos e bi\xf3logos! Uma cadeira j\xe1 foi posta ao lado de Johannes Gutenberg e J\xfcrgen Klopp, ser\xe1 que algum de nossos participantes atingir\xe1 o status de her\xf3i da cidade necess\xe1rio para se sentar com eles?","*Lang Tech+Agronutri*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Campo desmont\xe1vel do CROB - S\xe3o Carlos, Brasil\n*Desconto nas roupinhas de cachorro tem\xe1ticas da Copa:* 20%\n*Capit\xe3o:* Frevo\n*Participantes:* Adam, Dona N\xe1dia, Eskeleto, Fred, Frevo, Hilton, Jo\xe3o Paulo Personal, Lyncoln e Rafael\n\nRepresentando o suco do nepotismo, temos o time que combina empresa do pai com empresa do filho, das quais a m\xe3e e o irm\xe3o s\xe3o ~laranjas~ s\xf3cios e a esposa aparece para representar a empresa somente em viagens para destinos tur\xedsticos. A Lang Tech+Agronutri combina o avan\xe7o tecnol\xf3gico de uma empresa que (adicionar aqui o que a Lang Tech faz, porque eu n\xe3o sei) com a tradi\xe7\xe3o da maior rede de pet shops da regi\xe3o metropolitana de Cordeir\xf3polis. A bra\xe7adeira de capit\xe3o \xe9 carregada por Frevo, ele que n\xe3o tem certeza de quantos jogadores jogam num time de futebol e acha que volante \xe9 somente pe\xe7a de carro, mas mesmo assim achou que era uma \xf3tima ideia entrar num grupo extracurricular que faz rob\xf4s que jogam futebol e agora foi parar na lideran\xe7a de um time no Bol\xe3o dos Bol\xf5es. Mesmo utilizando a ferramenta do nepotismo, o plantel acabou ficando bem enxuto e, tamb\xe9m para garantir a melhor performance f\xedsica, o time fez a contrata\xe7\xe3o de \xfaltima hora de Jo\xe3o Paulo Personal para fechar a lista de convocados. Ser\xe1 que a experi\xeancia de m\xfaltiplas Robocups ir\xe1 ajudar o time a buscar a primeira Ta\xe7a Gamma ou ser\xe1 que mais uma vez ficar\xe1 claro que futebol de rob\xf4s tem muito mais a ver com rob\xf4s do que com futebol?","*Fam\xedlia Fiusa*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Golzinho de chinelo na rua - Tatu\xed, Brasil\n*Fator H:* 27\n*Capit\xe3o:* Fiusa\n*Participantes:* Adriano Imperador, Carol Curintia, Est\xeav\xe3o, Felipe Pereiralves, Fiusa, Gustavo Fiusa, Kiyoung, Pedro Harunari, Piconho e Seu Afonso Fiusa\n\nO participante nascido mais longe do Brasil, o participante com a participa\xe7\xe3o mais \xe9pica em um bol\xe3o, o participante com a mente mais brilhante. Estamos falando do Guinness, o livro dos recordes? N\xe3o, estamos falando de um livro de receitas. Misture esses ingredientes com a cole\xe7\xe3o de nomes mais exc\xeantricos do bol\xe3o e adicione o ingrediente final: o poder da amizade. Pronto, voc\xea tem em suas m\xe3os um time para deixar os advers\xe1rios sem dormir, tremendo de medo. Fiusa, o ex-menino prod\xedgio (hoje adulto prod\xedgio), tinha uma ideia de reunir um grupo de pessoas not\xe1veis para ver se elas poderiam se tornar algo maior (...), para travar as batalhas n\xe3o poder\xedamos (TAN TARAAAAAN TAN TAN TAAAAANN). Foi ao outro lado do mundo buscar o sul-coreano, Kiyoung, juntou-o aos cosplayers de craques brasileiros, Adriano Imperador e Est\xeav\xe3o, adicionou a devota da Igreja de Fernando Diniz, Carol Curintia, trouxe os atletas com nomes no m\xednimo diferente (necess\xe1rios em toda sele\xe7\xe3o vencedora), Piconho e Pereiralves, viajou a Paris esta semana para contratar Pedro Harunari para a comiss\xe3o t\xe9cnica. E, finalmente, para liderar os Vingadores do futebol, deu a camisa 9 a ELE, o odlanoR onaitsirC do Bol\xe3o, o homem que precisou de um \xfanico bol\xe3o para chocar o mundo e entrar para a hist\xf3ria, ele que mesmo acertando o palpite antecipado para o vice-campe\xe3o do Mundial de Clubes, ainda assim conseguiu amargar a lanterna, mas ganhar nossos cora\xe7\xf5es: Gustavo Fiusa! Mas uma equipe recheada de estrelas nunca funcionaria sem um Mr. Miyagi, um Mestre Yoda, um s\xe1bio mestre para gui\xe1-los. Fecha-se ent\xe3o o time com a cereja do bolo, o pai das lendas, Seu Afonso Fiusa, a voz da experi\xeancia necess\xe1ria para unir o time. Time? Que time? N\xe3o sabemos se basearam-se em Luiz Felipe Scolari ou em Dominic Toretto, mas nossos her\xf3is perceberam que a gl\xf3ria eterna n\xe3o pode ser alcan\xe7ada por um time, somente por... uma fam\xedlia!","*SAF #Arda*\n*Est\xe1dio:* #Arda1\n*Membros que n\xe3o aguentaram o clima do grupo e pediram para sair:* pelo menos 7\n*Capit\xe3o:* Seu Glaud\xe3o\n*Participantes:* Cynric, Eskeleto, Lopez \ud83e\udd48, Magalos, Merenor Lanfast, Seu Glaud\xe3o e Utz\n\nCuidado com as pessoas com quem seus filhos conversam na internet, eles podem acabar... jogando RPG \ud83d\ude33\ud83d\ude33\ud83d\ude33 Foi assim, cada um em seu quarto escuro, esperando dar meia-noite para pagar um \xfanico pulso de internet, com dedos sujos de salgadinhos, que nossos atletas se encontraram num servidor da BrasNET, o que mudaria suas vidas para sempre (n\xe3o estou dizendo que para melhor...). Os anos passaram, ficaram para tr\xe1s as aventuras repletas de charadas, as batalhas nas quais namorar o narrador valia mais do que correr em zig-zag e defender em X, as horas de Gama Game com a resposta mestra Fidel Castro, os cabelos l\xe1ureos ao vento, e vieram os desafios da vida adulta, os riscos do esquema de pir\xe2mide, o desgaste de trabalhar mais de 2 horas semanais, a falta de cuidado com a alfaiataria nos clipes de rap nacional, a importuna\xe7\xe3o da m\xe1quina de lavar roupas do vizinho, os riscos dermatol\xf3gicos dos tapetes, a solid\xe3o de morar em Serop\xe9dica, a indiferen\xe7a dos amigos ao esquecerem de voc\xea numa montagem do WhatsApp. Eu queria dizer que os desafios aparecem para serem vencidos, para nos tornarem pessoas melhores, mas n\xe3o, esse n\xe3o \xe9 o caso. Essa n\xe3o \xe9 uma hist\xf3ria de supera\xe7\xe3o, essa \xe9 uma hist\xf3ria de derrotas e derrotados. Mas derrotados que seguem conectados pela Chama Imperec\xedvel que nunca se apaga! O esquadr\xe3o ~suicida~ #Arda tem longa hist\xf3ria com o bol\xe3o, mas, tirando uma medalha vencida devido a uma falha nas regras, o hist\xf3rico \xe9, no melhor dos casos, vergonhoso. Vale lembrar que estamos falando do time que tem Cynric, ele que em 2018 conseguiu perder para uma participante que n\xe3o preencheu o bol\xe3o e o sistema considerou todas as apostas dela como 0x0! Mas os @Ops do canal projetam o in\xedcio de uma nova era. Seu Glaud\xe3o foi contratado para a equipe, recebeu a bra\xe7adeira de capit\xe3o e promete bater de frente com Dona N\xe1dia, a inimiga n\xfamero 1 do #Arda no bol\xe3o. E mais, depois de seguidas temporadas ruins, o time resolveu buscar capital externo e, ap\xf3s uma proposta irrecus\xe1vel de camelos e possivelmente Bitcoins (n\xe3o podemos confirmar nem negar) vindos do mundo \xe1rabe, o time se tornou uma SAF, a temida SAF #Ada. Lopez e Eskeleto conseguir\xe3o trazer de volta os tempos vitoriosos de Hurricane Flyers? Para saber mais, digite !Ajuda","*MWCSPM ft. Pentemel\xe3o*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Klimperkasten\n*N\xfamero de vezes que Evid\xeancias foi tocada na noite:* 4\n*Capit\xe3o:* Pelanza\n*Participantes:* Jan Spieck, Marinete, Michael, Ness, Oliver, Pelanza, Pierre-Louis, Ricardo Pentemel\xe3o e Toni\n\nPoucas coisas na vida unem as pessoas como o esporte une, e uma delas \xe9 a m\xfasica! Mas assim como o futebol que importa n\xe3o \xe9 jogado na grandes arenas, e sim nos campinhos de bairro, a m\xfasica de verdade n\xe3o acontece nos grande festivais, acontece nos karaok\xeas espalhados por a\xed, acontece no p\xfablico do bar j\xe1 fortemente alcoolizado se abra\xe7ando e balan\xe7ando as m\xe3os completamente fora do ritmo, acontece naquele momento que aquela pessoa super t\xedmida toma coragem, sobe ao palco e \xe9 ovacionada por outros cantores amadores que nunca viu na vida. Foi nesse mundo que Pelanza (n\xe3o, n\xe3o o das cal\xe7as coloridas, o do bigodinho) foi buscar a solu\xe7\xe3o para ~seus problemas da vida~ seu time do bol\xe3o. Com as mem\xf3rias das melhores noites Sancarlenses no Talenthus Karaoke, Pelanza saiu a perambular pelas ruas de Erlangen at\xe9 os deuses bo\xeamios o guiarem at\xe9 aquele lugar que conquistaria seu cora\xe7\xe3o, o Klimperkasten. Tempos depois, j\xe1 melhor amigo do MC Lukas, parceiro do porteiro, Jake, the bouncer, ele foi incorporado ao grupo com nome digno de m\xfasica da Clarice Falc\xe3o, Men Wear Colorful Shirts and Pick Mushrooms (MWCSPM). Essa era sua chance! Aos poucos plantou a sementinha do Bol\xe3o para ent\xe3o colher um time multinacional, da Am\xe9rica do Sul \xe0 Europa \xe0 Oceania. Mas ainda faltava algo para entrarem com chances s\xe9rias na disputa. Faltava um hit! E j\xe1 que iria atr\xe1s de um hit, por que n\xe3o do maior hit do Spotify 2025, Camar\xe3o e Patinete? Acionando seus contatos da ind\xfastria musical, Pelanza ent\xe3o chocou o mundo ao fechar a colabora\xe7\xe3o MWCSPM ft Pentemel\xe3o, que ainda n\xe3o sabemos se trar\xe1 medo \xe0s outras equipes, mas com certeza j\xe1 est\xe1 deixando Shakira e K'Naan sem dormir! Os f\xe3s est\xe3o em polvorosa, mas as pr\xf3ximas semanas nos dir\xe3o se s\xe3o realmente disco voador ou somente prato de sopa querendo voar!","*RTFC*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Nosso Clube - Limeira, Brasil\n*Tempo de jogo com o Rick sem segurar o R2:* 17 segundos\n*Capit\xe3o:* Rick Lima\n*Participantes:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49, Cabe\xe7a, Cau\xe3 Bandeira, Eskeleto, Guz\xe3o, Leme, M\xfcller \ud83e\udd48\ud83e\udd49, Pedro Zaros, Rick Lima e VH\n\nO ano \xe9 2006, naquele Dezembro amigos se reuniam na formatura de Rick Lima e ali formariam um dos times mais tradicionais do futebol infanto-juvenil do Nosso Clube de Limeira, o amado Rumo a T\xf3quio Futebol Clube. Esse momento marcaria para sempre a hist\xf3ria do bol\xe3o. Primeiramente, sem RTFC n\xe3o existiria o Bol\xe3o, pois foi defendendo as traves do RTFC num cl\xe1ssico de Nossoclub\xedadas que Eskeleto (hoje CEO e criador do Bol\xe3o), devido a um ato IRRESPONSABILIDADE de Zizi (hoje l\xedder testes do Bol\xe3o), sofreu uma grave les\xe3o no cotovelo (cujos detalhes ser\xe3o omitidos aqui, mas o grito de desespero de Cabe\xe7a, \xe0 \xe9poca zagueiro do time, ao ver a situa\xe7\xe3o ficou marcado na mem\xf3ria de todos os presentes). Les\xe3o essa que acabou mais tarde implicando em tr\xeas les\xf5es graves no joelho do nosso craque, uma cirurgia e dois anos e meio fora dos gramados, acabando com sua potencial carreira. Mas os deuses do futebol n\xe3o fecham uma porta sem abrir uma janela. Longe dos gramados, ele teve tempo para se dedicar ao seu real destino: criar e gastar milhares de horas no seu hiperfoco favorito, o Bol\xe3o do Gamma. Al\xe9m do impacto direto na cria\xe7\xe3o do Bol\xe3o, o RTFC tem sido figurinha marcada desde os primeiros torneios, tendo 4 dos \xfanicos 6 membros que participaram de todos os bol\xf5es at\xe9 hoje: Eskeleto, Zizi, M\xfcller e Rick Lima. A torcida pode ainda se lembrar com carinho das gl\xf3rias do clube, como o t\xedtulo do torneio sub-15, no qual enfrentavam times com jogadores que chegavam para o jogo dirigindo seus pr\xf3prios carros (pois \xe9, fa\xe7am as contas...). Mas esses tempos ficaram para tr\xe1s. Hoje, j\xe1 s\xe3o um total de sete cirurgias de joelho (que eu lembro, talvez tenham mais), duas cirurgias de h\xe9rnia, quatro beb\xeas, um pouco de esteroides, dentre outros fatores, restando ao time focar nas competi\xe7\xf5es extra campo. Mas fica aqui o questionamento: na Copa do Mundo, camiseta tradicional pesa ainda mais? Descobriremos ao longo dos pr\xf3ximos dias!","*Gr\xeamio AdS*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Rep\xfablica Amigos de S. - S\xe3o Carlos, Brasil\n*Item escolar preferido:* Mochila de crian\xe7a\n*Capit\xe3:* Prof. Calorina\n*Participantes:* Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Eskeleto, Gabbana, Karamba \ud83e\udd48, Paulinha, Pelanza, Prof. Calorina, Sindel e Tgueze \ud83e\udd48\n\n*Atl\xe9tico AdS*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Turbo Lanches - S\xe3o Carlos, Brasil\n*Rodovia preferida:* Anhanguera\n*Capit\xe3o:* Arretado\n*Participantes:* Andr\xe9, Andr\xe9 el Hobbit, Arretado, Caio, Dieni, Kaka, Ness, Prof. Gremista, Regueba e Uli\n\nUma cidade hist\xf3rica, terra dos Beatles, do Titanic ~e de Bobby Firmino (que nunca jogou no Liverpool!)~, regada a _fish and chips_ e, acima de tudo, terra de dois grandes times de futebol que dividem a cidade ao meio, Merseyside Red e Merseyside Blue (se voc\xea entendeu a refer\xeancia, favor passar na fila do INSS). Mas assim n\xe9... quem liga pra Liverpool?!! A hist\xf3ria que quero contar aqui \xe9 de uma cidade muito superior! Terra do Talenthus Karaok\xea, do Corso e do Turbo Lanches, a cidade de S\xe3o Carlos tamb\xe9m ter\xe1 uma polariza\xe7\xe3o hist\xf3rica que destruir\xe1 amizades e fam\xedlias. E n\xe3o, n\xe3o estou falando da elei\xe7\xe3o. A participa\xe7\xe3o d'Os amigos de S. (Supla?!) quebrou todas as expectativas, demonstrando ~que ningu\xe9m mais aguentava o Eskeleto e o Caio enchendo o saco para participarem~ um interesse contagiante no bol\xe3o! No entanto, devido a argumentos estat\xedsticos rasos, a organiza\xe7\xe3o resolveu limitar o n\xfamero de participantes por equipe e, portanto, os amigos de S. (Silvanus?!) tiveram de ser separados em dois! Uma fenda s\xedsmica separando amizades de mais uma d\xe9cada. Abra\xe7os tornaram-se provoca\xe7\xf5es, mensagens de feliz anivers\xe1rio repletas de emojis tornaram-se gritos de \xf3dio e uma grande fam\xedlia transformou-se em dois ex\xe9rcitos, n\xe3o muito diferente de um X-tudo frango com Catupiry, mas uma metade sem milho e a outra metade sem alface. Inspirados pela hist\xf3ria do futebol Sancarlense, nomearam-se Gr\xeamio Amigos de S. (Silvio Santos?!) e Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Shakira?!).\n\nA divis\xe3o acabou baseando-se em crit\xe9rios burocr\xe1ticos. Para participar do Gr\xeamio Amigos de S. (Sexta-feira?!), requereu-se ~traumas psicol\xf3gicos e poss\xedveis tratamentos~ forma\xe7\xe3o pelo Instituto de F\xedsica de S\xe3o Carlos, concentrando de um lado do Rio Monjolinho o passado, com as duas medalhas do bol\xe3o com Karamba e Tgueze, bem como o futuro, com as 3 crian\xe7as do grupo (essas poupadas do \xf3dio pelo time advers\xe1rio). Prof. Calorina, eleita capit\xe3 devido a seu not\xf3rio saber futebol\xedstico, guia um time com artilharia pesada, com armamento policial, bombas de flatul\xeancia, raios de controle mental e metralhadora de aluguel.\n\nDo outro lado do Rio Monjolinho, o Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Sasha?!) vem como a Lufa-Lufa de S\xe3o Carlos, aceitando todos os que foram recusados pelo crit\xe9rio burocr\xe1tico de seu rival. Liderada tanto financeiramente como atleticamente (mas principalmente financeiramente) pelo maior empres\xe1rio de S\xe3o Carlos, Arretado, o filho do Newton Talenthus, a equipe vem com um plantel multidisciplinar, da termodin\xe2mica qu\xe2ntica, \xe0s aulas de reda\xe7\xe3o, passando pelos laborat\xf3rios de biotecnologia, do est\xfadio de tatuagem aos cursos de coach no Instagram. Mas, al\xe9m disso, o Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Sonic?!) \xe9 o time do acolhimento e n\xe3o poderia aceitar a injusti\xe7a feita pela rival Sindel, que convidou tr\xeas novos participantes para o bol\xe3o, mas nenhum com os crit\xe9rios necess\xe1rios para participar do seu time. Evitando que as pobres almas ficassem sem time, o Capit\xe3o Arretado ofereceu-lhes a oportunidade de vestir as cores do Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Simba?!), fechando ent\xe3o a lista de convocados.\n\nQual metade da cidade de S\xe3o Carlos sair\xe1 mais feliz? Descobriremos, mas tudo o que esperamos \xe9 que a rivalidade e as provoca\xe7\xf5es fiquem apenas no \xe2mbito esportivo e n\xe3o saiam do controle!\n\n_Notas da comunidade: a informa\xe7\xe3o de que o Titanic \xe9 origin\xe1rio de Liverpool foi obtida por meios de intelig\xeancia artificial. A Diretoria que vos escreve abordou a situa\xe7\xe3o de forma imparcial e foi atr\xe1s de fontes confi\xe1veis para confirmar o dado. Que fique o registro de que tal dado \xe9 falso. O Titanic foi constru\xeddo em Belfast, na Irlanda do Norte e saiu em dire\xe7\xe3o a Nova Iorque partindo de Southampton, no sul da Inglaterra ao inv\xe9s de Liverpool. A Diretoria se reserva ao direito de se manter em sil\xeancio a respeito de quaisquer outras perguntas e termina clarificando que trabalha em prol do conhecimento de seu p\xfablico._","*Lorenhell*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Pista de skate do Santa Fel\xedcia - S\xe3o Carlos, Brasil\n*Funkos entregues para o Andrey:* 0\n*Capit\xe3o:* Patrick, o Capit\xe3o Hexa\n*Participantes:* Caio, Dr. Andrey, Eskeleto, L\xe9o Pinheiro, Patrick, Pedro Tati \ud83e\udd48, Pedrozzo, Tgueze \ud83e\udd48 e Thiago Admin\n\nUns t\xeam Messi, outros t\xeam Cristiano Ronaldo, outros t\xeam at\xe9 mesmo Tim Payne, mas a maior estrela desse mundial s\xf3 veste uma camisa: a do Lorenhell. Do palquinho da federal (~onde dizem que ele ficar\xe1 preso at\xe9 aceitarem o uso de ChatGPT no TCC~) para o mundo: Patrick, o Capit\xe3o Hexa! Seus pronomes? Bra/si/leiro \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Sua cor? Verde, amarelo, azul e branco \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Sua roupa? A camiseta da sele\xe7\xe3o \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Sua m\xfasica preferida? O hino nacional \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Seu status? 100% fechado com o hexa \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 Para o nosso \xedcone canarinho, a cereja no topo do bolo da experi\xeancia m\xe1xima do hexa (esse que todos j\xe1 temos certeza), seria levar tamb\xe9m o bol\xe3o desse ano t\xe3o especial. E qual a melhor forma de vencer o primeiro bol\xe3o da hist\xf3ria no formato FANTASY para uma Copa do Mundo de FUTEBOL jogada no solo AMERICANO se n\xe3o montando um time com experientes jogadores de fantasy de futebol americano?! Inclusive talvez tenha sido a falta do modo fantasy nos bol\xf5es da Copa de 2022 e das Olimp\xedadas de 2024 que fez com que o grupo IGNORASSE COMPLETAMENTE a Gamma Bol\xf5es Ltda. para essas disputas (nenhum ressentimento, juro \ud83e\udd7a\ud83e\udd7a...). Mas o passado foi superado e hoje o Lorenhell chega com um esquadr\xe3o imponente. Junto ao Capit\xe3o Hexa, temos a \xfanica pessoa do bol\xe3o que trabalha seriamente com futebol, nosso jornalista L\xe9o Pinheiro, o quarto melhor skatista careca da pista de skate do Santa Fel\xedcia, Pedrozzo, o atual defensor da medalha de prata do bol\xe3o, Pedro Tati, tr\xeas campe\xf5es do fantasy, Tgueze, Eskeleto e Thiago Admin, al\xe9m de tr\xeas doutores. Ah... tem o Andrey tamb\xe9m... O time estar\xe1 pronto para correr pelo Capit\xe3o Hexa e conquistar a t\xe3o merecida ta\xe7a? Ou os rachas no elenco com jogadores agindo como o tioz\xe3o do contra da Copa ou focados demais nas apostas extra bol\xe3o ir\xe3o impedir que a hist\xf3ria seja escrita como merecia?",'*Edmilsons United*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Est\xe1dio Martins Pereira - S\xe3o Jos\xe9 dos Campos, Brasil\n*Quantidade de lentilha consumida durante o torneio:* 4,7 kg\n*Capit\xe3o:* Edmilson Roque dos Santos\n*Participantes:* Edmilson dos Santos, Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Elias, Filipe Gomes, Gabriel Maciel, Guz\xe3o, Mois\xe9s, Pedro Zaros, Rafaela e Rowyn Chinnayya\n\n"N\xe3o senhor, desculpa, n\xe3o n\xe3o, aqui n\xe3o \xe9 o aplicativo GovBR, aqui \xe9 o aplicativo do Bol\xe3o do Gamma, isso..." Tudo sob controle, est\xe1 esclarecida a confus\xe3o na qual Edmilson queria se cadastrar com nome completo, RG e CPF! Edmilson? Pai ou filho? Sim! Num lindo momento de fam\xedlia os Edmilsons se unem em busca de fundar seu pr\xf3prio time para o Bol\xe3o. De um lado, Seu Edmilson recruta um ex\xe9rcito Joseense, com seu genro Gabriel Maciel e seus amigos, Mois\xe9s e Elias. Elias que de t\xe3o empolgado com a oportunidade foi um dos primeiros a preencher o bol\xe3o e, muito infelizmente, j\xe1 teve que mudar seu palpite para artilheiro no dia seguinte ao vir a tona a triste les\xe3o do craque Est\xeav\xe3o. J\xe1 do outro lado, Edmilson filho segue como um bardo n\xf4made segue vagando como um bardo n\xf4made questionando todas as pessoas poss\xedveis sobre seus pensamentos mais profundos e a raz\xe3o por tr\xe1s das suas escolhas de vida. Durante suas viagens por todos os cantos do mundo, adicionou \xe0 sua trupe o hoje morador de Toronto (~uma das sedes da Copa, algu\xe9m precisa de hospedagem?~), Filipe Gomes, e o representante da Maur\xedcia, Rowyn Chinnayya (voltaremos a esse ponto \ud83d\ude09). O time tomava forma, novos adeptos come\xe7avam a surgir, mas ainda faltava algo para pesar a camisa: experi\xeancia de t\xedtulo. Matutando por dias sobre como tampar esse buraco, Edmilson filho lembrou do maior momento de sua vida. Aquela tarde de pandemia em que, ap\xf3s partidas de tirar o f\xf4lego, venceu um torneio prata no Rocket League e, com o aconchego da lembran\xe7a, a luz se acendeu. Ele precisava convidar seu parceiro naquele hist\xf3rico t\xedtulo, o maior coach de games da regi\xe3o 19, Guz\xe3o! Guz\xe3o n\xe3o pensou duas vezes em aceitar e ainda trouxe novos refor\xe7os para o time, Pedro Zaros e Rafaela. Ser\xe1 que a parceira de sucesso vai ser suficiente para um time com relativamente pouca hist\xf3ria no bol\xe3o surpreender a todos?\n\n*Aqui cabe a importante nota que, com a apresenta\xe7\xe3o de Rowyn, fechamos os cinco an\xe9is ol\xedmpicos, com participantes das Am\xe9ricas (Brasil, Uruguai, Equador, M\xe9xico, EUA (e moradores do Canad\xe1)), \xc1frica (Maur\xedcia), \xc1sia (Coreia do Sul), Oceania (Austr\xe1lia) e Europa (Portugal, Cro\xe1cia, It\xe1lia, Fran\xe7a, Reino Unido e Alemanha)!! Fico honestamente feliz de saber que atingimos um bol\xe3o que traz o mundo todo junto, como deve ser a Copa do Mundo!!','*Panteras FC*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Arena Gol - Resende, Brasil\n*Porcentagem dos v\xeddeos enviados pelo Thiago e pelo Tati que realmente s\xe3o gola\xe7os:* 1,2%\n*Capit\xe3:* Let\xedcia Tati \ud83e\udd47\n*Participantes:* Arthur Soares, Let\xedcia Tati \ud83e\udd47, Luann Fran\xe7a, Marcelo Godoy, Pedro Tati \ud83e\udd48, Ruivo e Thiago Admin\n\nSe voc\xea, assim como eu, acompanhava o Casimiro quando ele passava mais tempo fazendo live reagindo a coisas aleat\xf3rias da internet do que revolucionando a m\xeddia de transmiss\xe3o futebol\xedstica, voc\xea talvez j\xe1 passou pelo v\xeddeo no qual ele reage ao epis\xf3dio do Shark Tank Brasil com a startup Filma Eu! A ideia? Genial, c\xe2meras em campos society para gravar os melhores momentos da sua pelada. Basta voc\xea apertar um bot\xe3o e os \xfaltimos 15 segundos s\xe3o salvos e enviados para voc\xea compartilhar nas suas redes sociais. O perigo? No momento da pelada, voc\xea tem certeza que aquele drible que voc\xea deu foi digno de Ronaldinho Ga\xfacho, aquele chute de tr\xe1s do meio de campo foi n\xedvel Roberto Carlos e n\xe3o tem goleiro no mundo que conseguiria pegar. A realidade? Voc\xea vai mandar esse v\xeddeo para outros amigos e vai tomar um ch\xe1 revela\xe7\xe3o. O seu "drible" parece que foi em c\xe2mera lenta e na verdade parece que voc\xea tava mais se esfor\xe7ando para manter o dom\xednio da bola porque nem defesa tinha para voc\xea driblar, eles estavam todos no ataque esbaforidos, xingando o outro que supostamente deveria ter voltado para marcar. O seu "bala\xe7o" do meio de campo foi um bal\xe3o no meio do gol que o goleiro n\xe3o defendeu porque ele se moveu com o tempo de bola de uma crian\xe7a de 4 anos e, no fundo, todos sabemos que ele nem sequer queria defender aquela bola para voltar logo para a linha. Foi com diversos desses cortes de 15 segundos com supostas obras de arte do futebol amador que conhecemos o esquadr\xe3o Panteras FC, o time que utiliza mais cones em campo do que o Detran. Mas, em defesa dos nossos atletas, bol\xe3o nunca foi sobre demonstrar futebol arte em campo e sim sobre ser craque nas planilhas e ali a hist\xf3ria est\xe1 do lado deles. Estreando no Bol\xe3o do Mundial de Clubes, o casal Tati chocou o mundo ao mostrar que o amor \xe9 mais forte que tudo e simplesmente cravar a dobradinha do bol\xe3o, com Let\xedcia Tati, eleita capit\xe3 para essa edi\xe7\xe3o, em primeiro e Pedro Tati, em segundo. O casal ter\xe1 um \xe1rduo trabalho para manter sua posi\xe7\xe3o no p\xf3dio, afinal chegar ao topo \xe9 dif\xedcil, se manter \xe9 muito mais, mas promete guiar o Panteras FC, com sua bela camisa cor de rosa, ao primeiro t\xedtulo da hist\xf3ria!',"*Tg-(UK)-ezers*\n*Est\xe1dio:* ZF - Birmingham, Reino Unido\n*Fraldas trocadas no dia:* 9\n*Capit\xe3o:* Tgueze \ud83e\udd48\n*Participantes:* Diego ZF, Douglas Augusto, Gabriel Toledano, Isa M\xfcller, Karamba \ud83e\udd48, M\xfcller \ud83e\udd48\ud83e\udd49, Natani ZF, Seu Claudemir, Tgueze \ud83e\udd48 e Thiag\xe3o ZF\n\nDois dos 6 \xfanicos participantes a participarem de todos os bol\xf5es. Dois medalhistas. Dois ex-atletas com joelho operado. Mas acima de tudo, dois pais de fam\xedlia. Tgueze e M\xfcller trazem uma alian\xe7a baseada na ~inserir um motivo para colocar os dois juntos porque ambos n\xe3o tinham gente suficiente para ter um time individual~ paternidade! Em sua \xfaltima Copa sem participar do bol\xe3o (eu cobrarei em 2030!), Matheus e Julia v\xeam representados por sua fam\xedlia. Do lado bauruense, pai, m\xe3e, tio e av\xf4 apoiam o jovem atleta que infelizmente ainda apresenta um hist\xf3rico de 2 derrotas e 0 vit\xf3rias na tradicional corrida anual contra seu pai. Do lado brit\xe2nico, pai e m\xe3e juntam for\xe7as a tr\xeas colegas de trabalho. Mas todo mundo sabe que um monte de tioz\xe3o que acha que entende de futebol nunca foi o caminho certo para prever a Copa do Mundo. Com isso e focando na transi\xe7\xe3o para a pr\xf3xima gera\xe7\xe3o, M\xfcller completa o time trazendo o jovem Gabriel Toledano para seu primeiro bol\xe3o. Com duas medalhas de cada lado do Atl\xe2ntico (Karamba, Tgueze e M\xfcller 2x), o time traz muita experi\xeancia no bol\xe3o e preocupa as equipes advers\xe1rias. Al\xe9m disso, nossos rep\xf3rteres acompanhando a prepara\xe7\xe3o pr\xe9-Copa nos trouxeram a informa\xe7\xe3o de que a equipe t\xe9cnica est\xe1 focando nas principais caracter\xedsticas dos dois craques: o p\xeanalti perdido de Tgueze (afinal, s\xf3 bate quem perde) e o chute forte sem dire\xe7\xe3o de M\xfcller! Gabriel Toledano conseguir\xe1 carregar o time nas costas ou teremos que esperar a estreia de Matheus e Julia no futuro para que o t\xedtulo venha?","*AstroSoccer*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Mult Sport, S\xe3o Carlos - Brasil\n*Valor por pessoa:* 10 reais em dinheiro\n*Capit\xe3o:* Xand\xe3o\n*Participantes:* Andr\xe9 el Hobbit, Andr\xe9s, Arretado, Caio, Donatello, Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Eskeleto, Fiusa, Pelanza e Xand\xe3o\n\nN\xe3o posso acreditar no que meus olhos veem! Buffon no gol fazendo milagre atr\xe1s de milagre, Anderson Polga, Danilo do Flamengo e Marquinhos trazendo seguran\xe7a na zaga, Pirlo ligando o contra-ataque com maestria, Lamine Yamal, Robben e Vini Jr. voando pelas pontas, Messi driblando defensor atr\xe1s de defensor e Ronaldo Fen\xf4meno recebendo a bola dentro da \xe1rea e n\xe3o dando a chance para o goleiro aparecer na foto. \xc9 um jogo de Ultimate Team na vida real? Ah n\xe3o, eu tava sem \xf3culos, calma a\xed... O que temos aqui no gramado sint\xe9tico do Mult Sport \xe9 s\xf3 o Eskeleto sentindo o joelho, Andr\xe9 e Caio batendo cabe\xe7a, Pelanza batendo no advers\xe1rio como se fosse UFC, Xand\xe3o tentando encobrir o goleiro e passando vergonha, Fiusa, Donatello e Chris confundindo futebol com maratona e correndo sem objetivo nenhum, Andr\xe9s perdendo o poder especial depois de se mudar da altitude e Arretado com os dois p\xe9s parafusados no ch\xe3o... que bela ter\xe7a-feira \xe0 noite... Mas calma l\xe1, 10 ~craques~ perna de pau? Isso n\xe3o d\xe1 nem 5 na linha de cada lado, que tipo de pelada \xe9 essa? Bom, \xe9 que hoje n\xe3o era dia de churrasco, ent\xe3o metade do grupo tem que levar a v\xf3 no jud\xf4, assistir o espet\xe1culo de bal\xe9 do gato de estima\xe7\xe3o, trocar o \xf3leo do motor da bicicleta... Mas nossos 10 atletas comprometidos v\xeam pra estender os momentos de gl\xf3ria dessa sele\xe7\xe3o para al\xe9m dos torneios com coletes SUPOSTAMENTE lavados e chuteiras cheias de borrachinha preta de society. Liderados pelo xerife de Bariri, Xand\xe3o, o foco \xe9 total em mostrar ao mundo que o Mult Sport S\xe3o Carlos \xe9 a Meca do Bol\xe3o!","*Deportivo Dona Maria*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Vila Camargo, Limeira - Brasil\n*Barris de chopp:* 0, porque foi proibido pelo Seu Hilton\n*Capit\xe3o:* L\xe9o Diversi \ud83e\udd47\n*Participantes:* Du, Hilton, Isa Roland, L\xe9o Diversi \ud83e\udd47, Marcelinho, Sara, Tend\xeancia \ud83e\udd49, Xuxu e Z\xe9 Diversi\n\nComo cravaram os especialistas do De Sola a Dez, n\xe3o existe nada que combine mais com Copa do Mundo do que aquele churrasco com os amigos e a fam\xedlia! Mas enquanto para alguns o churrasco \xe9 s\xf3 um momento de descontra\xe7\xe3o, para outros \xe9 um ritual quase sagrado. E quer algo mais sagrado do que se reunir semanalmente pelas \xfaltimas quatro d\xe9cadas? \xc9 isso mesmo, nossos her\xf3is, inimigos n\xfamero 1 do cardiologista, trazem um longo hist\xf3rico de encontros semanais regados a picanha, cerveja e truco. E enquanto o ideal manteve-se o mesmo ao longo dos anos, o local do encontro foi se adaptando ao longo do tempo. Foram diversos bairros na capital brasileira da joia folheada, ch\xe1caras na zona rural, al\xe9m de um tempo de vacas gordas em que o encontro acontecia na churrascaria. Mas todos os caminhos levaram ao templo final do churrasco limeirense: a casa da Dona Maria! Uma das moradoras mais c\xe9lebres da Vila Camargo, Dona Maria cedeu o quintal da sua casa para que seu filho Z\xe9 Diversi e seu amigo Hilton organizassem seu churrasco semanal com os amigos. Uns dizem que o pagamento foi na forma de p\xe3o com lingui\xe7a, outros dizem que foi pela companhia, outros dizem que ela n\xe3o teve escolha, mas a realidade que \xe9 ao longos dos anos, o local passou de uma simples churrasqueira com uma geladeira e pia para um parque de divers\xf5es para os amantes da brasa, com mesa de truco feita sob medida, televis\xe3o pr\xf3pria para assistir futebol, banheiro externo para n\xe3o atrapalhar a Dona Maria durante o churrasco. E \xe9 liderado por ningu\xe9m menos que o neto de Dona Maria, atual l\xedder do ranking hist\xf3rico do Bol\xe3o do Gamma e vencedor do Bol\xe3o da Copa de 2018, L\xe9o Diversi, que o Deportivo Dona Maria vem para o torneiro desfilando o time com o maior n\xfamero de procedimentos card\xedacos, a maior m\xe9dia de idade, o participante mais velho do bol\xe3o, mas tamb\xe9m a participante mais nova! Ser\xe1 que ao longo de todos os anos acumulou-se o conhecimento futebol\xedstico necess\xe1rio para o t\xedtulo ou ser\xe1 que acumulou-se somente o colesterol?","*AC Shevy*\n*Est\xe1dio:* El Gigante de Acero - Monterrey, M\xe9xico\n*Tacos de ternera:* 5 por favor\n*Capit\xe3o:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49\n*Participantes:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49, Clarise, Isaac, Jo\xe3o Pedro, J\xfalia, Kamila, Luan do Carmo, Lucas Lot\xe9rio, Ronaldo e Ta\xeds \ud83e\udd47\n\nVoc\xea conhece cachorro com nome de artista, voc\xea conhece cachorro com nome de comida, voc\xea conhece cachorro com nome de personagem, voc\xea provavelmente conhece at\xe9 cachorro com nome de gente velha. Mas eu duvido que voc\xea conhe\xe7a cachorro com nome de ex-futebolista ucraniano, a n\xe3o ser que voc\xea conhe\xe7a ele: o vira-lata mais carism\xe1tico de toda a Am\xe9rica Latina, que derrete cora\xe7\xf5es com suas orelhas, uma de p\xe9 e a outra ca\xedda. Nomeado devido \xe0 idolatria (no m\xednimo \xfanica...) de Zizi por Andriy Shevchenko, Shevy \xe9 o mascote do nosso \xfanico time baseado em uma das sedes da Copa do Mundo. Com longa hist\xf3ria no Bol\xe3o, seus tutores, Zizi, l\xedder de testes e participante desde a primeira edi\xe7\xe3o, e Ta\xeds, campe\xe3 do Bol\xe3o das Olimp\xedadas, decidiram montar seu pr\xf3prio time para levar a ta\xe7a para Monterrey. Numa filosofia diferente dos outros capit\xe3es, Zizi foi atr\xe1s de sangue novo, que chegasse com vontade de mostrar servi\xe7o em sua primeira participa\xe7\xe3o na principal competi\xe7\xe3o mundial de an\xe1lises esportivas. S\xe3o simplesmente 8 participantes de primeira viagem, 3 vindos de sua fam\xedlia, 4 da di\xe1spora brasileira no M\xe9xico e um mexicano para gui\xe1-los aos melhores carrinhos de taco da regi\xe3o! A comiss\xe3o t\xe9cnica agiu r\xe1pido, garantindo o melhor centro de treinamento da cidade para o time e, com isso, for\xe7ando a delega\xe7\xe3o japonesa a ter que se preparar num CT no m\xednimo abaixo do esperado para uma sele\xe7\xe3o de Copa do Mundo. Ser\xe1 que a filosofia adotada por Zizi se comprovar\xe1 eficaz e os nossos jogadores correr\xe3o atr\xe1s da ta\xe7a como Shevy corre atr\xe1s de seu frisbee ou ser\xe1 que o time ir\xe1 se decepcionar como algu\xe9m querendo um docinho e descobrindo que a bala era de tamarindo?","*DGE Esporte Clube*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Campo de futebol da UFSCar - S\xe3o Carlos, Brasil\n*M\xe9dia de idade:* 180,3 anos (mediana: 31 anos)\n*Capit\xe3o:* Kaka\n*Participantes:* Caio, Ju Virg\xednio, Kaka, Mari\xe1, MK, Paloma, Regueba e Seu M\xe1rcio\n\nO que acontece quando voc\xea mistura Taq polimerase, dNTPs, primers, DNA do objeto de interesse, \xe1gua, cloreto de magn\xe9sio e tamp\xe3o? NADA! Porque PCR \xe9 uma mentira!! A verdade dos laborat\xf3rios de bio s\xe3o os amigos que voc\xea faz pelo caminho, os sobreviventes de anos cuidando de ratos, peixes e gaviais (~se voc\xea n\xe3o sabe o que \xe9 um gavial, procure, \xe9 um primo feio dos jacar\xe9s e dos crocodilos~), os her\xf3is em tratamento para LER de tanto pipetar, as companhias nas visitas ao laborat\xf3rio nos hor\xe1rios mais esdr\xfaxulos para alimentar as c\xe9lulas, os aliados na guerra contra os maiores inimigos: os f\xedsicos. Direto do pa\xeds-sede, Canad\xe1, e auxiliada por ~seus muitos anos de vida~ sua companheira felina Curie, a capit\xe3 Kaka buscou os melhores m\xe9todos estat\xedsticos para chegar na sua lista de convocados. Avaliou diferentes conjuntos de dados com N=8 passando por um programa de R que calcula ANOVA e, analisando os box plots finais de cada hip\xf3tese, escolheu aquela com valor p menor que 0,05 (n\xe3o, n\xe3o houve penaliza\xe7\xe3o na signific\xe2ncia devido \xe0 vasta explora\xe7\xe3o do espa\xe7o de fase). Publicou ent\xe3o a lista final, com alto fator de impacto. O n\xfacleo principal do time \xe9 formado pelo quarteto com anos de experi\xeancia jogando junto na base do ~DGGE~ DGE da UFSCar e hoje espalhado em tr\xeas continentes: Kaka no Canad\xe1, Ju Virg\xednio no Brasil, Regueba e Caio na Alemanha. A primeira expans\xe3o do plantel vem do lado tupiniquim, com Ju Virg\xednio trazendo Mari\xe1 e MK para o elenco. A segunda vem com o objetivo de atrair ainda mais o p\xfablico canadense, com Paloma representando mais uma moradora da terra do h\xf3quei no gelo e, finalmente, Seu M\xe1rcio traz a experi\xeancia ~clubista~ futebol\xedstica de quem j\xe1 assistiu o Zico para expandir os horizontes t\xe1ticos da equipe. Resta agora saber se a camiseta do DGE Esporte Clube chegar\xe1 em agosto com uma estrela dourada. Sim, a camiseta de futebol, pois \xe9 um time formado por pessoas que sabem que jaleco \xe9 algo que se usa somente no laborat\xf3rio e n\xe3o na rua, no restaurante ou na foto do Zap para farmar respeito classista.","*Fam\xedlia Guedes Lang*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Ch\xe1cara Lang - Limeira, Brasil\n*Dentes na boca do Gamma:* 3\n*Capit\xe3o:* Benjamin\n*Participantes:* Benjamin, Dona Marisa, Dona N\xe1dia, Eskeleto, Hilton, Rafael, S\xedlvia, Vitor Nardy e Zel\xe3o\n\nOs participantes do Bol\xe3o (e qui\xe7\xe1 a popula\xe7\xe3o mundial) podem ser divididos em dois grandes grupos: aqueles que j\xe1 jogaram o biribol mais competitivo do Brasil, j\xe1 participaram da maior e mais tradicional festa junina da regi\xe3o 19, j\xe1 comeram a melhor costela da zona rural limeirense, j\xe1 lutaram por um cantinho para dormir na casa lotada de colch\xf5es e aqueles que s\xe3o tristes. Para a metade feliz, claramente n\xe3o preciso nem dizer do que estou falando, mas fica aqui o convite para a metade mais triste: estejam convidados a conhecer a experi\xeancia \xfanica da Ch\xe1cara Lang. E \xe9 l\xf3gico que um local de tamanha import\xe2ncia n\xe3o poderia ficar de fora das sedes do Bol\xe3o. Mandando seus jogos na Ch\xe1cara Lang, a Fam\xedlia Guedes Lang vem com um time unido por la\xe7os familiares, mas com um dos elencos mais heterog\xeaneos do Bol\xe3o. S\xe3o tr\xeas gera\xe7\xf5es, indo daqueles que assistir\xe3o \xe0 sua d\xe9cima s\xe9tima Copa at\xe9 o jovem capit\xe3o da equipe, Benjamin, em seu primeiro Bol\xe3o com palpites conscientes. Cobrindo os opostos complementares da esfera do conhecimento e da experi\xeancia humana - do cientista \xe0 artista - e das classes sociais - com o engenheiro e a advogada oferecendo esmolas para o cientista e para a artista. Uma fam\xedlia rachada no futebol de clubes devido \xe0s rivalidades entre Corinthians e Palmeiras e entre Cruzeiro e Galo e agora, no futebol de sele\xe7\xf5es, contaminada pelo brasileiro que torce pela Argentina. Mas acima de tudo, um time focado em um objetivo: que o Trof\xe9u Gamma fique na casa do Gamma... Ser\xe1 que a jovem promessa Benjamin ir\xe1 se provar um novo Lamine Yamal ou apenas um novo Lulinha do Corinthians? Rafael e Dona N\xe1dia v\xe3o conseguir, depois de SEMANAS de cobran\xe7a, arrumar 5 minutos do seu dia para lan\xe7arem seus palpites? Dona Marisa conseguir\xe1 superar o que fez com aquele palpite de Botafogo 1 x 0 PSG? Berenice vai deixar o nosso \xedcone Gamma comer sua comida em paz? Est\xe1 tudo nas m\xe3os dos deuses do futebol!","*LDU Astrof\xedsica*\n*Est\xe1dio:* Pampa La Bola, Chile\n*Altitude:* 4770 m\n*Capit\xe3o:* Andr\xe9s\n*Participantes:* Andr\xe9s, Daniel, Eskeleto, Kaori, Matheus, Pelanza, Victor Barbosa e Vitor de Souza\n\nAbrimos a temporada de convoca\xe7\xf5es com a efici\xeancia alem\xe3 trazendo a lista do time europeu da astrof\xedsica e \xe9 claro que s\xf3 poder\xedamos fechar com aquele jeitinho latino. ~Claramente atrasado~ Como menino Ney na fila de entrada para o hino, o time sul-americano da astrof\xedsica \xe9 o \xfaltimo a entrar e \xe9 recebido pela fuma\xe7a dos sinalizadores, pela chuva de papel higi\xeanico e por um caramelo pronto para entrar em campo e paralisar o jogo assim que a bola rolar. O time sul-americano tem na manga as cartas para enfrentar seu rival europeu: o futebol arte, baseado no drible e no gingado, e a malandragem de quem cresceu jogando bola na rua e sabe que a press\xe3o de uma arena de uma das grandes ligas n\xe3o chega aos p\xe9s da press\xe3o de bater um p\xeanalti na final do Primeiro de Maio. Ou assim seria, se n\xe3o fosse formado por um monte de f\xedsicos, dos quais muitos nunca vestiram uma chuteira na vida... o que resta \xe9 confiar no \xfanico com potencial real para ser craque. Com o poder especial da altitude, que tanto assusta os times sul-americanos (~e que os europeus entrariam em choque e pediriam para a FIFA mudar as regras se tivessem que jogar um jogo de Copa l\xe1~), nosso equatoriano Andr\xe9s foi eleito capit\xe3o da equipe e homenageado com o nome da equipe. A Liga Deportiva Universitaria Astrof\xedsica promete unir a alegria e ousadia sul-americanas com o rigor estat\xedstico dos astrof\xedsicos, formando a receita perfeita para otimizar o valor esperado de pontos para o campeonato (porque tamb\xe9m est\xe3o cientes que o futebol \xe9 um esporte de baixas contagens altamente Poissoniano e, portanto, a vari\xe2ncia esperada \xe9 alt\xedssima, o que faz com que qualquer pessoa/equipe que afirme que sabe que ser\xe1 campe\xe3 n\xe3o entenda nada de estat\xedstica). Que ~os dados rolem~ a bola role e o extenso espa\xe7o de fase de poss\xedveis resultados colapse para um e que muitos gr\xe1ficos sejam gerados no processo!"],t.w)
B.yG=new A.Y(B.zM,["*Diretoria do Bol\xe3o*\n*Venue:* Gamma Arena\n*Average number of plots generated per day:* 107.3\n*Captain:* Eskeleto\n*Participants:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49, Caio, Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Eskeleto, Fiusa, Kaka, Pelanza, Tgueze \ud83e\udd48 and Xand\xe3o\n\nLet's start with the Board team. Just like the Brazilian Football Confederation needs Flamengo (to make the local championship interesting, otherwise is downroad (_opinion inserted by Caio, but disagreed upon by the rest of the board_)), Gamma Bol\xf5es Enterprises comes with their own team. A squad that comes with work and quality! - at least in respect to preparing the Bol\xe3o, because when it comes to the competition itself the team has a history of failures and underground performance, comparable to New Zealand... Led by the Bol\xe3o Commissioner Eskeleto, the Board comes with the 9 participants that form the very own nucleus (the Kern \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea) of the Bol\xe3o graph network, with every participant being related to at least one of the 9 members of the Board. The locker room environment, this year, comes different. Pressured by past results, players promise to take the championship seriously, but we'll see in the upcoming weeks if the team will be the underdog, the charismatic squad that everybody loves and hopes to stay in the first league or if it will become a serious title contender, even raising some BASELESS denunciations about possible fraudulent activities in Bol\xe3o's results.","*1. KSV Astrophysik 26*\n*Venue:* Gebbertstra\xdfe - Erlangen, Germany\n*Total number of fields lent by Guido for the training camp:* 0\n*Captain:* Martin \ud83e\udd47\n*Participants:* Benedetta, Bennie S\xe1nchez, Franzi, Gerrit, Hannes, Jelena, Jonas F., Martin \ud83e\udd47 and Stefan\n\nIt's undeniable the stereotype that physicists do not like football so much, and although those do not apply to everybody, the 2010 version of Eskeleto shockingly noticed that, indeed, this stereotype was in general true. Henceforth, the International Federation of Astrophysics Sport Studies (IF...ASS) was drowning in fear of not being able to form a squad for the Ultimate Bol\xe3o. However, if there's something even more stereotypical about physicists than their general lack of interest in football is their hyperfocus on plots and statistical analyses! With that, the ~turns have tabled~  tables have turned! Not only was it easy to form a team, but the members outnumbered the rules for individual teams and, then, we needed to divide them. On one side, the European team that, thanks to the German efficiency, already has their final list. Led by the Euro 24 Bol\xe3o champion, Martin, the squad was taken almost fully by Germans - except they could not leave behind their EU associate, Benedetta, who already needs to stand the pain of not seeing her home country avoid the World Cup for the third time in a row. With this, the 1. Kicktipp Sport Verein Astrophysik 26 comes as the single team without Brazilians and with its entirety of participants coming from the old continent. In the history of World Cups, 11 happened in Europe, of which 10 were won by Europeans ~GUESS WHO WON THE ELEVENTH???~, while 11 World Cups happened outside of Europe, only twice won by European sides ~2014 was a collective hallucination, forget about it~. Does 1. KSV Astrophysik 26 have what it takes to break this fate and make the trophy cross the pond?","*Mainz 06*\n*Venue:* Mewa Arena - Mainz, Germany\n*Ice creams by the Rhein on a summer afternoon:* 12,423\n*Captain:* Caio\n*Participants:* BitoBike, Caio, Carol Akemi, Chris Blum, Dominik, Eric Che Schmitt, Joana Figueiredo, Regueba and Yannic\n\nThat smile. That damned smile. If you live in Mainz, you know very well that I'm talking about the blinding shiny smile of J\xfcrgen Klopp, the historical manager who in 2004 took the white, red and gold squad to the Bundesliga, the top-flight level of football in Germany, from where they never again left. What? Ah, sorry, I got it wrong, apparently I shouldn't be talking about Mainz 05, but actually about its descendant, Mainz 06! As founder and captain of the squad, our dear Caio - Bol\xe3o Content Analyst - brings a mix of Brazil, Germany and Portugal with a central connecting point: the city of Mainz, capital city of Rheinland-Pfalz (ok, Caio, I will let people know there's a river in the city...). For starters, the team brings one candidate for the best participant name in our Bol\xe3o, BitoBike; on the other hand, several ~biologists~ biotechnologists form the squad, being one of the two Biology sides that will bring up the heat against the two Astrophysics teams, once again raising the eternal statistical fight between Biology and Physics! A throne has already been set between Johannes Gutenberg and J\xfcrgen Klopp, but is any of the players capable of reaching the level of a city hero to take it and sit among the eternals?","*Lang Tech+Agronutri*\n*Venue:* Campo desmont\xe1vel do CROB - S\xe3o Carlos, Brazil\n*Sale discount on World Cup-themed dog apparel:* 20%\n*Captain:* Frevo\n*Participants:* Adam, Dona N\xe1dia, Eskeleto, Fred, Frevo, Hilton, Jo\xe3o Paulo Personal, Lyncoln and Rafael\n\nRepresenting the best there is around about nepotism, we have the squad that joins on one side the father's company with the son's company - in which mother and brother are there as ~fake~ partners, while the wife is the legal representative when it comes to negotiating with partners in coastal cities and paradisiac islands. Lang Tech+Agronutri brings together the technological advances of Lang Tech, a pioneer company that (come up with something in your head, because I don't know what they do), with the traditional embrace of the biggest chain of pet-care stores in the metropolitan area of Cordeir\xf3polis (24,514 inhabitants according to Brazil's national census of 2022). The captain band is worn by Frevo, he who doesn't know how many players there are in a football team and thinks that right-back is just an expression for being here again soon, yet thought it would be a great idea to join an extracurricular activity that demands producing robots that play football and now was brought up as the boss of a squad in the biggest Bol\xe3o in history. Although taking advantage of the perks that come with nepotism, the squad ended up quite short - which led them to a last-minute recruitment: Jo\xe3o Paulo Personal, brought specifically for improving the physical sturdiness of the team. Will the experience of several Robocups help the team to bring home the first ever Gamma Trophy or will it once again be clear that robot football is more about robots than football?","*Fam\xedlia Fiusa*\n*Venue:* On the streets with flip flops (Havaianas!) as goal posts - Tatu\xed, Brazil\n*H-factor:* 27\n*Captain:* Fiusa\n*Participants:* Adriano Imperador, Carol Curintia, Est\xeav\xe3o, Felipe Pereiralves, Fiusa, Gustavo Fiusa, Kiyoung, Pedro Harunari, Piconho e Seu Afonso Fiusa\n\nThe participant who was born the furthest from Brazil, the participant with the most remarkable participation, the brightest mind of our Bol\xe3o. Are we talking about the Guinness (book, not beer)? No no, we're talking about a recipe book: take these ingredients, mix well with the most eccentric set of names in our list and add the most special ingredient, the power of friendship. There you go, you have on your hands a team able to shake your opponents up, cutting up their sleep the whole night. Fiusa, the former prodigy boy (today prodigy adult), had an IDEA of bringing together a group of remarkable people, to see if they could become something more (...), to fight the battles others never could (TAN TARAAAAAN TAN TAN TAAAAANN). He went across the world to bring the South Korean Kiyoung. He found the Brazilian footballers cosplayers, Adriano Imperador and Est\xeav\xe3o. He brought Carol Curintia, a follower of the Church of Fernando Diniz Of The Latter Days. He brought athletes with special names (special in THAT sense) that are the centre of winning teams, Piconho and Pereiralves. He went to Paris this week to bring Pedro Harunari to his managerial team. And finally, to lead his Football Avengers, he gave the #9 to HIM, the Bol\xe3o's odlanoR onaitsirC, the man that needed a single edition to bring the world to its knees and put his name in history; he who guessed right the runner-up of the Club World Cup last year but still tasted the bitterness of the last place. Yet, became the sweetness in our hearts, our superstar Gustavo Fiusa! But a full constellation of renowned players would never work without a Mr. Miyagi, a Master Yoda, a wise master to guide them through. Here comes into play the last piece, the crown jewel, the legends' father, Seu Afonso Fiusa, bringing the necessary experience to make this team roll. Wait, team? What team? I'm not sure whether they based themselves on Luiz Felipe Scolari or on Dominic Toretto, but our heroes noticed that eternal glory can't be reached by a single team, but only by... a family!","*SAF #Arda*\n*Venue:* #Arda1\n*Member who couldn't handle the group's atmosphere and left:* at least 7\n*Captain:* Seu Glaud\xe3o\n*Participants:* Cynric, Eskeleto, Lopez \ud83e\udd48, Magalos, Merenor Lanfast, Seu Glaud\xe3o and Utz\n\nAs every parent says, please take care of what and who your kids are talking to on the internet, they might end up... playing RPG \ud83d\ude33\ud83d\ude33\ud83d\ude33 It was like that, each one of them in their locked and dark room, waiting for the clock to hit midnight so the phone company would not charge a kidney for internet access, with cheesy Doritos fingers, that this team's athletes met each other in a BrasNET server, which changed their lives forever (I never said for the better...). Years went by and they became fond memories, all the adventures full of charades, all the battles in which dating the narrator was more important than running in zig-zag or defending in X, all the hours of Gama Game with the master key answer Fidel Castro, and the golden hair by the wind, those unfortunately stayed in the past. Present came with the usual challenges of the adult life, such as risks of pyramid schemes, the efforts of working longer than 2 hours a week, the lack of touch in costume design in Brazilian rap videoclips, the annoying screaming of a neighbor's laundry machine, the risks to your skin when exposing yourself to tapestries, the solitude of living in Serop\xe9dica, the indiference of your friends when they forget to add you on a WhatsApp montage. I'd like to say that challenges exist to be overcome, that they make us better people, but that is definitely not the case. This is not a redemption or inspiring story, this is a story of defeats and defeated. But those defeated still stick together through the Flame Imperishable that is never put out! This suicide squad, the #Arda squad, has a long history with the Bol\xe3o, but except for a medal won due to a loophole in the rules, this long history is, in the best-case scenario, one to go down in history of shame. Please remember that we are talking about a squad that has Cynric as a member, he who in 2018 lost to a participant that only had 0x0 guesses. But the @Ops of the channel project the start of a new era. They recruited Seu Glaud\xe3o, who was given the captain band to wear and promises to exterminate Dona N\xe1dia, #Arda's archnemesis in the Bol\xe3o. Not only that, but after a sequence of trifle results, the team opened itself for external investments and found an offer they could not refuse: camels and perhaps Bitcoins (we do not confirm or deny) coming from the Oil Gulf. With that, the team was corrupted and sold to the industry as the now feared SAF #Arda. Can Lopez and Eskeleto bring back the Hurricane Flyers glorious times? To know more, type !Ajuda","*MWCSPM ft. Pentemel\xe3o*\n*Venue:* Klimperkasten\n*Number of times Scandal was played during the night:* 4\n*Captain:* Pelanza\n*Participants:* Jan Spieck, Marinete, Michael, Ness, Oliver, Pelanza, Pierre-Louis, Ricardo Pentemel\xe3o and Toni\n\nFew things in life create a bond among people like sports do, but one of them is music! In the same way as true football is not actually played in the great arenas, but in the small neighborhood fields, true music is not about big festivals and concerts, but about the small karaokes spread around, about the moment the audience is a bit more than slightly drunk and is already standing up, hugging strangers and waving their arms in the air totally out of rhytim, about that moment when the shiest person takes some courage, comes on stage and is applauded by other amateur singers that they have never seen in their lives. It was in this scene that Pelanza (not the one with the colorful pants, but the one with the stylish mustache) searched for a way of solving ~his life problems~ the composition of his Bol\xe3o team. Never forgetting the memories created in S\xe3o Carlos nights at Talenthus Karaoke, Pelanza wandered around the streets of Erlangen until the bar gods guided him to the place that would win his heart, Klimperkasten. Some time afterwards, already best friends with MC Lukas, a bro to the doorman, Jake, the bouncer, he was incorporated into the group named as a song from Fall Out Boy, Wear Colorful Shirts and Pick Mushrooms (MWCSPM). This was his shot! Slowly, he planted the Bol\xe3o idea to gather a multiethnic team, from South America to Europe to Oceania. But something was still missing, something to make them become true contestants for the title, the great hit was missing! And since they were already going after the big hit, why not the biggest hit of 2025 on Spotify, Camar\xe3o e Patinete? Putting together his contacts within the music industry, Pelanza struck the music world by bringing a collab, MWCSPM feat. Pentemel\xe3o - although we still don't know whether they'll bring fear to other teams, they for sure have already brought to Shakira and K'Naan, keeping them awake at night! Fans are shaking with excitement, but the next few weeks will tell us whether they are true flying saucers or just soup plates wanting to fly!","*RTFC*\n*Venue:* Nosso Clube - Limeira, Brazil\n*Game time with Rick not holding R2:* 17 seconds\n*Captain:* Rick Lima\n*Participants:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49, Cabe\xe7a, Cau\xe3 Bandeira, Eskeleto, Guz\xe3o, Leme, M\xfcller \ud83e\udd48\ud83e\udd49, Pedro Zaros, Rick Lima and VH\n\nThe year was 2006, the month was December, and friends were gathering for Rick Lima's prom. They didn't know yet the importance of that moment, but that was the founding time of one of the most traditional teams of youth football from Nosso Clube de Limeira, the beloved Rumo a T\xf3quio Futebol Clube. This moment would forever change the history of the Bol\xe3o. First, without RTFC there would be no Bol\xe3o, since it was in between the goal posts in a derby during Nosso Clube Olympic Games that Eskeleto (nowadays CEO and Comissioner), due to a RECKLESS attitude from Zizi (today Head of Testing), suffered a major injury in his elbow (audience will be prevented of details, but the scream heard from the then centre-back Cabe\xe7a after he saw the goalkeeper status still echoes in members' memories). This injury was the back story for three upcoming major knee injuries in our star, one surgery and two and a half years away from the pitch, which ended up finishing any (~is zero considered any?~) chance he had to become professional. But the football gods do not close a door without opening (~a broken roof tile in the attic~) a window. Away from the pitch, he had time to dedicate to his true destiny: create and ~waste~ spend thousands of hours in his favorite hyperfocus, the Bol\xe3o do Gamma. Apart from the direct impact in creating the Bol\xe3o, RTFC has been a guaranteed presence since the first tournament, with 4 in the list of the 6 participants that were there in all Bol\xe3o editions to date: Eskeleto, Zizi, M\xfcller and Rick Lima. The crowd can still remember with nostalgia the club achievements, as the U15 title against opponents that were already driving their own cars (I know, do the math....). But these times are behind us. Today, the number of knee surgeries (that I can remember, maybe there were more) rose to 7, two for hernias, 4 babies and a bit of (~legal advice starts here~) protein supplementation (~legal advice ends here~), which made the team focus on the outside better than inside demands. But the question of the hour is: during the World Cup, is the most traditional jersey still enough to win? We'll find out soon!","*Gr\xeamio AdS*\n*Venue:* Rep\xfablica Amigos de S. - S\xe3o Carlos, Brazil\n*Favorite school item:* Children's backpack\n*Captain:* Prof. Calorina\n*Participants:* Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Eskeleto, Gabbana, Karamba \ud83e\udd48, Paulinha, Pelanza, Prof. Calorina, Sindel and Tgueze \ud83e\udd48\n\n*Atl\xe9tico AdS*\n*Venue:* Turbo Lanches - S\xe3o Carlos, Brazil\n*Favorite highway:* Anhanguera\n*Captain:* Arretado\n*Participants:* Andr\xe9, Andr\xe9 el Hobbit, Arretado, Caio, Dieni, Kaka, Ness, Prof. Gremista, Regueba and Uli\n\nThink of a historical city. Let's imagine The Beatles' hometown, also home to the Titanic ~and Bobby Firmino, who indeed played for Liverpool~ and with a more than diverse selection of fish and chips options. Above all, it is also home to two big football clubs that divide the city in two: Merseyside Red and Merseyside Blue (if you understand this reference, please already contact your pension scheme provider). But well... who cares about Liverpool? The story I want to tell here is from a much more important city! Land of Talenthus Karaoke, land of the Corso and Turbo Lanches, the city of S\xe3o Carlos is also in the middle of a historical division, source of destruction of friendships and families. And no, I am not talking about Brazilian federal elections. The participation of the Amigos de S. (Friends of S.) (Steve Wonder?!) broke all expectations, showing that ~nobody could stand up anymore Eskeleto and Caio forcing them to participate~ a remarkable excitement about our Bol\xe3o! However, due to some at least shaky statistical reasoning, the Board decided to limit the number of members per team and therefore the Friends of S. (Silvanus?) needed to be split in two! An abyss separating more than a decade of friendship. Hugs turned into taunting, happy birthday messages full of emojis turned into hateful shouts and a big family turned into two armies, not too different from a Chicken Cheese and Everything sandwich with extra catupiry, mas one half without corn and the other half without lettuce. Inspired by the story of S\xe3o Carlos football, they named themselves Gr\xeamio Amigos de S. (Samuel L. Jackson?!) and Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Shakira?!).\n\nThe split ended up based in bureaucratic criteria. To be part of the Gr\xeamio Amigos de S. (Saturday?!), it was required ~psychological trauma and possible treatment~ an official education from the S\xe3o Carlos Institute of Physics, concentrating on one side of the Monjolinho River the past, with two previous Bol\xe3o medals - Karamba and Tgueze -, and the future, with 3 children, which were kept away from the hatred of the rival team. Prof. Calorina, democratically elected captain due to her exceptional knowledge of football, leads a team of fiery attack, including police weaponry, bombs of intestinal gas, mind control rays and inexplicable interest in other people's lives.\n\nOn the other side of Monjolinho, the Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Sabrina Carpenter?!) comes as S\xe3o Carlos' own Hufflepuff, accepting all who were denied by their rival's standards. Led both financially and athletically (but mainly financially) by the main entrepreneur of S\xe3o Carlos, Arretado - son of Newton Talenthus -, the team brings in a multidisciplinary squad, ranging from quantum thermodynamics and biotechnology laboratories to writing expertise, from tattoo studios to Instagram coaching lectures. But, beyond all that, Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Sonic?!) is the team of embracing and could not just accept the injustice perpetrated by the rival's participant Sindel, who invited three new members for her Bol\xe3o team although they do not match any of her own team criteria. To avoid the poor souls from being teamless, Captain Arretado offered them the chance to wear the colours of Atl\xe9tico Amigos de S. (Simba?!), then closing the list of players.\n\nWhich half of S\xe3o Carlos will be happily ever after? We will soon find out, but what we expect above all is that this rivalry and the trash talk will stay only within the Bol\xe3o matter and under control!\n\n_Community notes: the information that the Titanic is from Liverpool was obtained through means of artificial intelligence. The Board approached the situation in an unbiased manner and actively searched from reliable sources to confirm this information. May it be noticed this information is false. The Titanic was built and assembled in Belfast, Northern Ireland, and sailed in direction of New York from Southampton, south coast of England, instead of Liverpool. The Boards reserves itself to the right to stay in silence in respect to any further questions and states that continuously works for its audience knowledge._","*Lorenhell*\n*Venue:* Santa Fel\xedcia skate park - S\xe3o Carlos, Brazil\n*Funkos delivered to Andrey:* 0\n*Captain:* Patrick, a.k.a. Captain Six Stars\n*Participants:* Caio, Dr. Andrey, Eskeleto, L\xe9o Pinheiro, Patrick, Pedro Tati \ud83e\udd48, Pedrozzo, Tgueze \ud83e\udd48 and Thiago Admin\n\nSome have Messi, others have Cristiano Ronaldo, and some even have Tim Payne ~GOAT~, but the main star of this World Cup wears a single jersey: Lorenhell. From UFSCar's underground parties (~which some say he will be held until people accept the usage of ChatGPT for writing of his bachelor's thesis~) to the world: Patrick, Captain Six Stars! His pronouns? Bra/Zi/Lian \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 His colour? Green, yellow, blue and white \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 His clothes? Brazil national team jersey \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 His favorite song? Brazil's national anthem \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 His relationship status? 100% into getting the sixth star \ud83c\udde7\ud83c\uddf7 For our Canarinho icon, the chef's kiss on top of Brazil bringing home the sixth trophy (which we are all sure of) is also Lorenhell bringing home the Bol\xe3o's trophy in such a special edition of the tournament! And what is the best way to win the first-ever edition with FANTASY mode when the FOOTBALL World Cup is played on AMERICAN soil? To bring together an expert group of american football fantasy players! To be honest maybe it was the absence of a fantasy mode in 2022 Bol\xe3o and 2024 Olympics Bol\xe3o that made the team FULLY IGNORE Gamma Bol\xf5es Enterprises for those tournaments (no hard feelings, I swear \ud83e\udd7a\ud83e\udd7a...) But the past is in the past and this year Lorenhell comes with a strong squad. Together with Captain Six Star, they have the only single person that professionally works with football - our journalist Leo Pinheiro -, the fourth best bald skater in the half pipes of Santa Fel\xedcia - Pedrozzo -, the current Bol\xe3o silver medalist - Pedro Tati -, three official champions of NFL Fantasy - Tgueze, Eskeleto and Thiago Admin -, apart from three actual doctors. Ah, they also have Andrey... Is the team ready to run for Captain Six Stars and bring home the so-deserved title? Or will the internal disputes between the Sele\xe7\xe3o haters and the betting addicted players keep the team from writing history as it should?","*Edmilsons United*\n*Venue:* Est\xe1dio Martins Pereira - S\xe3o Jos\xe9 dos Campos, Brazil\n*Amount of lentils consumed during the tournament:* 4.7 kg\n*Captain:* Edmilson Roque dos Santos\n*Participants:* Edmilson dos Santos, Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Elias, Filipe Gomes, Gabriel Maciel, Guz\xe3o, Mois\xe9s, Pedro Zaros, Rafaela and Rowyn Chinnayya\n\n\"No sir, no no, this is not your social security app, this is the Bol\xe3o do Gamma app, yes...\" Ok, all under control, issues were solved regarding Edmilson wanting to sign up with full name, ID and tax payer number. Wait, Edmilson?! Senior or junior?! Yes!!! In a beautiful family moment, the Edmilsons decided to *unite* themselves and founded their own team for the Bol\xe3o! On one side, Seu Edmilson recruited something like a real army in Joseense lands, with his son-in-law Gabriel Maciel and his friends, Mois\xe9s and Elias. Elias who was so excited with the chance of participating in the biggest bol\xe3o in history that was one of the first to make all the predictions - which unfortunately didn't turn out so well since the very next day he needed to change his top scorer due to the sad injury of Est\xeav\xe3o. On the other side, Edmilson son ~(this was not an echo)~ keeps wandering as a nomad bard asking every possible person their deepest thoughts and reasons for their life choices. During his wanderings of every single piece of land there is, he added to his group a member with a current address in Toronto ~(if you are unaware, it is one of the World Cup host cities, does anyone need a place to stay?)~, Filipe Gomes, and the representative from Mauritius \ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\uddfa Rowyn Chinnayya (we'll be back to that soon \ud83d\ude09). The team was taking shape, new supporters were starting to show up, but something was still missing to make the team more solid: a winning experience. Carefully thinking for days about how to fill in this empty space, Edmilson son ~(still not an echo)~ remembered about the most iconic day of his life: a pandemic-forced social isolation afternoon that after so many tries and breathtaking matches in Rocket League, he managed to win a Silver Tournament - and, with that warm memory, something lit up in his head. He needed to invite his partner in crime in that historic title, the most renowned game coach in the (19) phone area, Guz\xe3o! Guz\xe3o did not think twice about being on board and still brought reinforcements to the team, Pedro Zaros and Rafaela. Will the successful partnership be enough for this team to make a hit in the Bol\xe3o, even though they have a relatively short story in our tournaments?\n\n*Here we want to strongly highlight that, with the addition of Rowyn, we complete all the five Olympic rings, with participants from the Americas (Brazil, Uruguay, Ecuador, Mexico, USA and inhabitants of Canada), Africa (Mauritius), Asia (South Korea), Oceania (Australia) and Europe (Portugal, Croatia, Italy, France, UK and Germany)!! We are truly touched and happy that we managed to create a Bol\xe3o that brings the world together, as it should be for the World Cup.",'*Panteras FC*\n*Venue:* Arena Gol - Resende, Brazil\n*Percentage of the videos sent by Thiago and Tati that actually show a nice goal:* 1.2%\n*Captain:* Let\xedcia Tati \ud83e\udd47\n*Participants:* Arthur Soares, Let\xedcia Tati \ud83e\udd47, Luann Fran\xe7a, Marcelo Godoy, Pedro Tati \ud83e\udd48, Ruivo and Thiago Admin\n\nIf you, just like me, spent most of your time during the pandemic and right after watching streamers reacting to whatever before they actually started doing something else than Twitch, you may have encountered them watching Shark Tank. One of the big Brazilian streamers (really big) reacted once to a start-up idea named "Put Me on Camera!" The idea?! A genius call about installing cameras on seven-a-side football pitches to record the ~worst~ best moments of your weekly ~atrocity~ friendly football. You just need to press a button and the last 15 seconds of recording are saved and sent to you to share on social media. The trick? While playing, you are 100% sure you dribbled just like Ronaldinho, you hit a curved ball just like Roberto Carlos, and there is no keeper in the world able to stop you; but actually, you\'ll send these videos to your friends and get a reality check. Your "dribble" looks like it was in 0.5x speed and that you were struggling to keep the ball under control, because there was not even a defense trying to stop you. The "defense" was staying still on the attacking side because no one wanted to run all the way back and they were just complaining with each other about who should\'ve stayed back. Your "100 km/h kick" looked as if you were playing friendly volleyball with the keeper but with your foot, and the ball just went in because he moved as quick as a 4-year-old, and deep down we know he didn\'t want to stop that because his turn under the posts would be done. Due to those 15-seconds-long ALLEGED masterpieces of amateur football that we came to know Panteras FC, a team with more lampposts on the grass than a park in Paris. But we need to acknowledge that our athletes know that when it comes to the Bol\xe3o, it was never about showing your abilities on the pitch, but about being a master in spreadsheets, and this is where they are on the right side of history. Premiering in the Club World Cup Bol\xe3o, the Tati Couple shocked the world with the power of love and put their names in gold and silver, with Let\xedcia Tati as champion - and elected as team captain this year - and Pedro Tati as runner-up! The couple will have a hard time, as maintaining the top is harder than getting there, but they promise to guide Panteras FC, with their beautiful pink shirt, to the first title ever!',"*Tg-(UK)-ezers*\n*Venue:* ZF - Birmingham, UK\n*Daily diaper changes:* 9\n*Captain:* Tgueze \ud83e\udd48\n*Participants:* Diego ZF, Douglas Augusto, Gabriel Toledano, Isa M\xfcller, Karamba \ud83e\udd48, M\xfcller \ud83e\udd48\ud83e\udd49, Natani ZF, Seu Claudemir, Tgueze \ud83e\udd48 and Thiag\xe3o ZF\n\nTwo of the only 6 participants to be present in all the Bol\xe3o editions. Two medalists. Two former athletes with unnatural knee composition. But above all, two fathers! Tgueze and M\xfcller bring an alliance based on ~(add a reason for them being together because individually they didn't have enough cofcof friends cofcof members for separate teams)~ fatherhood! In their last World Cup not being part of the Bol\xe3o, Matheus and Julia (I'll be there in 2030 asking!) see themselves represented by their family. On the Bauru side, father, mother, uncle and grandpa are supporting the little athlete that unfortunately still holds a record of 2 straight defeats in his traditional yearly run against his dad. On the British side, father and mother join forces with 3 co-workers. But everybody knows that a bunch of oldies that think they know about football was never the path to follow for successfully guessing the World Cup. With that in mind and focusing on the transition to the next generation, M\xfcller completes the team by bringing the young Gabriel Toledano to his first Bol\xe3o. With two medals on each side of the Atlantic (Karamba once, Tgueze once and M\xfcller twice!), the squad brings in tons of experience (the amount of experience Tgueze accumulated over the long number of years is indeed something) in the Bol\xe3o and makes the other teams worried. Besides, our colleagues reporting in loco, watching their preparation for the World Cup closely, informed us that the managers are focused on the specialties of the two main players: Tgueze's missed penalty shot (because, you know, those who shoot are the ones that miss) and the strong pointless shots from M\xfcller! Can Gabriel Toledano carry the piano or will we need to wait until Matheus and Julia are in for the title to come?","*AstroSoccer*\n*Venue:* Mult Sport - S\xe3o Carlos, Brazil\n*Price per person:* 10 BRL in cash\n*Captain:* Xand\xe3o\n*Participants:* Andr\xe9 el Hobbit, Andr\xe9s, Arretado, Caio, Donatello, Edmilson Roque dos Santos, Eskeleto, Fiusa, Pelanza and Xand\xe3o\n\nI can't believe my eyes! Buffon is performing miracle after miracles; Anderson Polga, Danilo from Flamengo and Marquinhos are safely holding in the back, Pirlo is just about connections and counterattacks while Lamine Yamal, Robben and Vini Jr. are spreading the defense as butter on a warm toast, Messi is dribbling every single one of them and Ronaldo ~(don't you dare think about Cristiano Ronaldo, we're talking about the ACTUAL Ronaldo)~ is not giving any chances for the keeper. Is this an Ultimate Team real-life version? Oh, no, I lost my glasses for a sec, hold on... What we have on the pitch of Mult Sport is just Eskeleto complaining about his knee, Andr\xe9 and Caio bumping each other, Pelanza pretending to be on UFC to break the opponent legs, Xand\xe3o embarrassing himself while trying to fool the keeper, Fiusa, Chris and Donatello mixing the sports and practicing Athletics instead of football in a completely futile running, Andr\xe9s not having the altitude superpower to literally leave the adversary breathless, while Arretado has both feet nailed to the ground... what a beautiful Tuesday evening... But wait wait, 10 ~superstars~ crooked players? This makes less than five field players a side, what kind of match is this?! Well, today wasn't a match followed by barbecue, so half the group needed to take their grandmas to judo class, some were watching a ballet presentation of their cats, some needed to change the bicycle's engine oil, some even showered their fish... But our 10 committed athletes come to increase the moments of glory of this selected group beyond the ALLEGEDLY washed training vests and the shoes full of black rubber pieces. Led by Bariri Sheriff, Xand\xe3o, they come with laser eyes to show the audience that Mult Sport S\xe3o Carlos is the Mecca of Bol\xe3o!","*Deportivo Dona Maria*\n*Venue:* Vila Camargo - Limeira, Brazil\n*Draft beer kegs:* 0, because they were forbidden by Seu Hilton\n*Captain:* L\xe9o Diversi \ud83e\udd47\n*Participants:* Du, Hilton, Isa Roland, L\xe9o Diversi \ud83e\udd47, Marcelinho, Sara, Tend\xeancia \ud83e\udd49, Xuxu and Z\xe9 Diversi\n\nAs specialists say, there's nothing more World Cup-y than some good grilling under the sun with family and friends! But while for some barbecue is just a relaxing time, for others it is pretty much a sacred ritual. And is there something more sacred than meeting religiously every week for the last _FOUR DECADES_? That's it, our heroes and number 1 enemies of the cardiologists, bring with them a long history of weekly meetings flooded with picanha ~(will not be translated, if you unfortunately do not know what I'm talking about, that's unfortunate for you)~, beer and truco ~(unfortunately, same as before)~. While the principles of the gathering are kept the same from the beginning, the place was being adapted through the years. There were many of those in several neighborhoods of the Brazilian capital of plated jewelry, farms in the rural area, and whenever there would be more financially generous times, steakhouses. But all the roads led to the temple of Limeira's barbecue mythology: Dona Maria's home! One of the most renowned inhabitants of Vila Camargo, Dona Maria kindly hosted in her backyard her son's gang's (led by the young Z\xe9 Diversi and his friend Hilton) weekly barbecue. Some say the backyard's rent was paid in cheap meat, others say that was the warm company, others say she just didn't have a choice, but reality is that as years went by, the place was no longer just a grill and sink with a fridge on the side, but became an amusement park for the charcoal fans, with customised truco table attractions, dedicated football-exclusive TV and even external bathroom to not be in the way of Dona Maria while the barbecue is on. And who else would they be led by other than Dona Maria's grandson, current leader of the historical record of the Bol\xe3o and winner of the 2018 Bol\xe3o Edition, L\xe9o Diversi? Deportivo Dona Maria comes as the team with the highest number of cardiac procedures, the highest age average including the oldest participant, but also the youngest! Will all the years have accumulated enough football knowledge to bring the title home or just accumulated cholesterol in their veins?","*AC Shevy*\n*Venue:* El Gigante de Acero - Monterrey, Mexico\n*Tacos de ternera:* 5 please\n*Captain:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49\n*Participants:* -Zizi \ud83e\udd49, Clarise, Isaac, Jo\xe3o Pedro, J\xfalia, Kamila, Luan do Carmo, Lucas Lot\xe9rio, Ronaldo and Ta\xeds \ud83e\udd47\n\nYou know dogs named after artists, you know dogs named after food, you know dogs named after fictional characters, you probably even know dogs with elderly names. But I BET ~(the whole prize I'm gonna win)~ you don't know a dog with the name of a former Ukrainian football player! Unless you know him: the CAN TURNER ~(or in less proper English, stray dog)~ with the highest level of charisma in Latin America, capable of melting hearts with the flappy ears, one standing and the other resting. Named due to Zizi's idolatry (particular to say the least...) for Andriy Shevchenko, Shevy is the mascot of the only team based on a World Cup host city. With a long history in Bol\xe3o, his tutors Zizi, our Head of Testing, and Ta\xeds, champion of the 2024 Olympics Bol\xe3o, decided to form their own team to bring ~football~ the title home, in Monterrey. In a different philosophy compared to other captains, Zizi went after fresh meat, looking for members showing strong will to put actual effort on their first participation in the biggest world competition of sports analysis. There are simply 8 first-time players, 3 from his own family, 4 from the Brazilian diaspora in Mexico and one Mexican to guide them to the best local taco places! Management acted swiftly, guaranteeing them the best training ground in town and, with that, forcing the Japanese squad to prepare themselves at nothing but a lame centre for World Cup standards. Can Zizi's philosophy prove itself flawless with the players going after the trophy as Shevy goes after his frisbee or may the team disappoint itself as someone looking for a piece of sweet and then finding out it is a tamarind candy?","*DGE Esporte Clube*\n*Venue:* UFSCar's football field - S\xe3o Carlos, Brazil\n*Average age:* 180.3 years (median: 31 years)\n*Captain:* Kaka\n*Participants:* Caio, Ju Virg\xednio, Kaka, Mari\xe1, MK, Paloma, Regueba and Seu M\xe1rcio\n\nWhat happens when you mix Taq polymerase, dNTPs, primers, a template DNA, water, magnesium chloride and a buffer? NOTHING ~(editor's note: haters gonna hate hate hate hate hate)~, because PCR is a lie! The truth within biology labs is the friends you make along the way, the survivors after years taking care of rats, fishes and gharials ~(look them up! They are the ugly cousins of alligators and crocodiles!!!)~, the heroes in treatment for RSI (repetitive strain injury) after so many pipetting hours, the companies to visit the labs in ridiculous times to feed animals or cells, the allies in the trenches against the science archnemesis: the physicists! Directly from the host country Canada, and supported by her ~many years of life~ cat partner Curie, captain Kaka searched for the best statistical methods to get to her final players list. She evaluated different data points from her experimental groups with number of events = 8, going through R analyses that calculate ANOVAs and, analysing the boxplots to check the outcome of each hypothesis, she chose the one with a _p_ value < 0.05 (no, there was no trial factor penalty due to the phase space vast exploration) ~(editor-s note: funny how the physicist tries very hard to bully bio without getting the basic principle of the area.... anyway....)~. She then published her final list, with a very high impact factor! The team's main nucleus is composed of the four-person ~string quartet~ group with long years of experience playing in ~DGGE~ DGE junior's team and today spread across three different continents: Kaka in Canada, Ju Virg\xednio in Brazil, Regueba and Caio in Germany. First expansion of the squad comes from the tupiniquim side, with Ju Virg\xednio bringing Mari\xe1 and MK to the team. Second comes with an even more expansionist intent to the Canadian public, as Paloma represents another inhabitant of the ice hockey land and, finally, Seu M\xe1rcio brings the ~biased~ football experience of someone who has watched Zico play to expand the tactical horizons of the team. Now we need to know whether DGE Esporte Clube's jersey is getting a golden star in August. Yes, in their jersey, because it is a team that knows that a lab coat should be worn only in the lab and not on the street, restaurant, WhatsApp photo just to gather society respect to their own working class etc, etc...","*Fam\xedlia Guedes Lang*\n*Venue:* Ch\xe1cara Lang - Limeira, Brazil\n*Teeth in Gamma's mouth:* 3\n*Captain:* Benjamin\n*Participants:* Benjamin, Dona Marisa, Dona N\xe1dia, Eskeleto, Hilton, Rafael, S\xedlvia, Vitor Nardy and Zel\xe3o\n\nBol\xe3o participants (and some may say even world population) can be divided into two groups: those who have played the most competitive water volleyball in the country, attended the most traditional June party of the (19) code area, ate the most famous ribs of Limeira's rural area, fought for a one squared meter area to sleep in a house full of mattresses on the ground and those who are sad. To the happy half, clearly I don't need to clarify myself, but for those who are part of the unfortunate half, you are cordially invited to get to know the unique experience of Ch\xe1cara Lang. And of course, such an important place could not not host a team in the Bol\xe3o. Playing their home matches at Ch\xe1cara Lang, Family Guedes Lang comes with a team united by family bonds, but with one of the most heterogeneous squads in Bol\xe3o. 3 generations, from those watching their 17th World Cup to the young captain Benjamin, in his first self-conscious Bol\xe3o. Covering the complementary opposites of human knowledge and experience - from the scientist to the artist - and working classes - as the engineer and the lawyer need to donate their leftovers to the scientist and the artist. A broken family when it comes to club football due to the conflicting supports for Corinthians and Palmeiras, and Cruzeiro and Atl\xe9tico Mineiro. When it comes to national teams, the family also feels contaminated by the Argentine-supporting Brazilian. They, however, are united and laser-focused on a common goal: to make the Gamma Trophy stay at... Gamma's home. Can the young star Benjamin prove himself a new Lamine Yamal or just a Peter Crouch from good old Liverpool? Will Rafael and Dona N\xe1dia, after WEEKS of supplications, find 5 minutes of their day to send their guesses? Will Dona Marisa break expectations once again and get a perfect score such as the Botafogo 1x0 PSG in the Club World Cup? Can Berenice leave our star Gamma eat his food at peace?! Everything sits in the hands of the football gods!","*LDU Astrof\xedsica*\n*Venue:* Pampa La Bola, Chile\n*Altitude:* 4770 m\n*Captain:* Andr\xe9s\n*Participants:* Andr\xe9s, Daniel, Eskeleto, Kaori, Matheus, Pelanza, Victor Barbosa and Vitor de Souza\n\nWe opened the announcement season with German efficiency, calling the European astrophysics team and, of course, that would mean we could only close with the ~clearly late~ Latin way ~(editor's note: it's 23h29 and I'm writing this while our CEO asked me to hand this in some good 3 hours ago)~. As Ney is the last one to enter the pitch for the national anthem, the South American astrophysics team is the last to be called, being received by a passionate crowd, illuminating the night sky with fireworks, intimidating the adversary with heavy smoke flares and thousands of toilet paper rolls being thrown into the pitch, while a ~can turner~ common caramel stray dog is ready for action whenever the opponent has a clear chance to score and stop the match. The South American squad has under the sleeve the moves to face the European opponent: football in the form of art, the Joga Bonito, based on dribbling and smooth movements, bringing also the malice of who grew up playing barefoot on the streets and knows that the pressure of an arena doesn't come even close to the pressure of a penalty shoot at the finals of First of May. Well, that would be the case if the team wasn't formed by a bunch of physicists, some that have never worn football boots in their lives... The hope here is the only member with the potential to be a star player. With the altitude on their side, which already brings shivers to some South American teams ~(and that Europeans would be shocked if they'd play there and would immediately ask FIFA to change the sport rules if there would ever be a World Cup up the hill)~, our Ecuadorian friend Andr\xe9s was elected team captain and as a tribute a special choice for the team's name. The Liga Deportiva Universitaria Astrof\xedsica promises to join the South American Ousadia&Alegria ~(free translation as Boldness &Happiness)~ with the rigorous statistics from physicists, forming the perfect union to optimise the expected points for the tournament (also because they are aware that football is a highly Poissionian sport with low number of events and, therefore, the expected variance is extremely high, which shows us that any team or person who affirms they gonna win doesn't actually know squat of statistics). May ~the dice roll~ the ball be played and the extensive phase space of possible results collapse to one, with many plots being generated in the way!"],t.w)
